<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '13px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 31, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>核心优化：位姿求解是作者自己写的 GPU 核</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>13 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '5px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>论文没有调用 g2o / Ceres / CUDA-BA，第 ⑤ 步的 BA 从残差到求解全是自己写的：<b>雅可比解析、LM 迭代、Schur 消元、位姿更新，四步都留在显存里</b>。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '7px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#1E1E1E', borderRadius: 5, padding: '5px 10px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8FBBFF' }}>优化 1　手写解析雅可比，废掉 autograd</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#7F8C9F', marginBottom: 2 }}>poses/mini_ba_utils.cu:133</Text>
                <Image src="opt_png/01.png" style={{ width: 579, height: 173 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#1E1E1E', borderRadius: 5, padding: '5px 10px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8FBBFF' }}>优化 2　手写 se(3) 指数映射，更新融成一个核</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#7F8C9F', marginBottom: 2 }}>poses/mini_ba_utils.cu:186</Text>
                <Image src="opt_png/02.png" style={{ width: 579, height: 173 }} />
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#1E1E1E', borderRadius: 5, padding: '5px 10px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8FBBFF' }}>优化 3　Schur 补与 Cholesky 不落回 CPU</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#7F8C9F', marginBottom: 2 }}>poses/mini_ba.py:296</Text>
                <Image src="opt_png/03.png" style={{ width: 579, height: 191 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#1E1E1E', borderRadius: 5, padding: '5px 10px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8FBBFF' }}>优化 4　整轮 LM 压成一张 CUDA Graph</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#7F8C9F', marginBottom: 2 }}>poses/mini_ba.py:506（无分支写法见 :391）</Text>
                <Image src="opt_png/04.png" style={{ width: 579, height: 191 }} />
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ margin: '9px 40px 0px 40px', backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '9px 18px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>省掉反向图</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>雅可比手推成解析式，残差与 J 一核同出。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>省掉主机同步</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>观测追加 atomicAdd 抢 slot，不等 CPU 派号。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>省掉启动开销</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>上百次 LM 迭代提交一次图，不许有分支。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '6px 40px 10px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>行号指向片段起点；为投影宽度做了换行与变量缩写（v = jacxr_cam − BD @ jacxr_xyz），逻辑未改。共同点不是算法更聪明，而是<b>把每一步都做成 GPU 原生的形状</b>——这才是「普通显卡上实时」的落点。</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
